ن، وكون خبرها جملة\n# PageV01P011\n# مفصولة - إن بدئت بفعل متصرف غير دعاء – ب\"قد أو تنفيس أو نفي أو لو\"\n~~وأما كأن فتعمل ويقل ذكر اسمها، ويفصل الفعل منها ب\"لم أو قد\" ولا يتوسط\n~~خبرهن إلا ظرفا أو مجرورا نحو {إن في ذلك لعبرة} ms05 ، {إن لدينا أنكالا} ،\n","scope":"The inna case rule, not a certificate for the lexical annotations.","source":"src/nabt/data/source_evidence/qatr.txt","span_sha256":"6cab9860da9f0068855fa60715334acb28e33e83a5fe271138865a68f587dc11","start":15482},"schema":"nabt.inna-fragment-transport-material.v1","selection":"Both selected lexemes retain all three written forms already in the fixture.","source_acquisition_established":false,"source_files":[{"bytes":4581,"path":"examples/construction_training.tsv","sha256":"06ff1e42fb60dfc45b49df9d029e197314a791f72c683ae8e692fc1e2e6f4e0e"},{"bytes":40168,"path":"src/nabt/data/source_evidence/qatr.txt","sha256":"2d9241beca1b138187ace8f6782d5eed68f3864f402ec1d5fc90fdeb306ceb9d"}],"source_is_qac_quotation":false,"source_status":"PREEXISTING_AUTHORED_INSTRUCTIONAL_LEXICON_NOT_EXTERNAL_ACQUISITION","target_used_to_build_lexicon":false,"transliteration":{"A":"ا","F":"ً","K":"ٍ","N":"ٌ","a":"َ","d":"د","i":"ِ","k":"ك","m":"م","o":"ْ","r":"ر","y":"ي","z":"ز"}}
